## Six Interactive Dashboard Demos

### Demo Cards
1. **SaaS Platform** - Multi-tenant KPIs & usage analytics
2. **E-commerce Store** - Sales funnel, AOV, cohort retention
3. **Corporate Dashboard** - OKRs, team throughput, risk heatmap
4. **Custom App** - Automation runs, queue health, SLA tracker
5. **Media Hub** - Content performance, watch time, CPM
6. **Education/Niche Solution** - LMS progress, quiz stats, churn

### Shared Dashboard Requirements
- Portal to body, backdrop blur, spring scale-up
- Shared-element layoutId="demo-{id}" transitions
- Focus trap, Esc to close, return focus to originating card
- Top bar: title, date-range, filters, search, export, share, reset
- Content: 3-5 stat tiles, 2 charts, paginated data table
- Live filtering (local mock data), cross-filtering, brush-to-zoom
- Command palette (Cmd/Ctrl+K) with filter commands

## Framer Motion Animation System

### Global Motion Tokens
```typescript
export const motion = {
  spring: {
    snappy: { type: "spring", stiffness: 420, damping: 34 },
    soft: { type: "spring", stiffness: 260, damping: 28 }
  },
  fadeUp: {
    initial: { opacity: 0, y: 16 },
    animate: { opacity: 1, y: 0, transition: { duration: 0.4 } }
  },
  durations: { fade: 0.24, overlay: 0.28, staggerChild: 0.06 }
};
```

### Animation Requirements
- Respect prefers-reduced-motion user preference
- Hero section: staggered entrance animations
- Demo cards: hover lift y-6 + subtle tilt, focus rings
- Modal transitions: shared-element layoutId, backdrop blur
- Skills section: animated accordions with height: auto
- Charts: springy mount animations, counter 0→value (~600ms)

